### Set lineup (plantilla) for a club in a match (replace with actual IDs)
### Players are optional (max 22), coach is required, physical trainer is optional.
### All member data is stored as a copy (snapshot).
POST http://localhost:8080/api/lineups
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "matchId": 1,
  "clubId": 1,
  "playerIds": [
    1,
    2
  ],
  "coachId": 1,
  "physicalTrainerId": "REPLACE_WITH_PHYSICAL_TRAINER_ID"
}

### Set lineup without physical trainer
POST http://localhost:8080/api/lineups
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "matchId": 1,
  "clubId": 1,
  "playerIds": [
    3,
    4,
    5,
    6,
    7
  ],
  "coachId": 1
}

### Get full match lineups (both clubs) - replace with actual match ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/lineups/match/REPLACE_WITH_MATCH_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get lineup for a specific club in a match (replace with actual IDs)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/lineups/match/1?clubId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get lineup for a specific club in a match (replace with actual IDs)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/lineups/match/1/club/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
